BT /F1 8.50 Tf 59.00 515.00 Td (doorstep collection logistics system where municipal drivers publish free shift windows and operating) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.50 Tf 59.00 503.20 Td (areas, enabling citizens to book doorstep pickups for household, bulk, e-waste, and society trash; and \(3\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.50 Tf 59.00 491.40 Td (A bilateral privacy handshake protocol masking sensitive phone numbers until mutual job acceptance is) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.50 Tf 59.00 479.60 Td (confirmed. Backed by a dual-tier hybrid persistence model \(sub-millisecond local reactive state with) Tj ET
